biting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--><!--Decree Prohibiting Tensha--> [[Category:December 1870]]
